      "text": "Let your shoulders soften. Allow your jaw to relax, and let your hands rest comfortably. For a few moments, simply notice the quiet rhythm of breathing. You do not need to make the breath deeper or slower. Just notice the breath arriving, and notice the breath leaving, one gentle cycle at a time.",
